-- The native stem 照準 exists both as an immutable bare binding and as a live sidecar mask. Only the sigiled spelling is shadowed.
--! registry ../registries/103-native-sigils.reg
--! expect 印 = .#..#.
--! expect 打撃 = 0 1 0 0 1 9
--! expect 派閥 = 山賊 勇者 山賊 勇者 山賊 賊軍

照準 , 打撃 += 1
^照準 & 派閥 == :勇者 , 打撃 = 9 ; 派閥 = :賊軍
